        "The source warns against two extremes:\n- Pure one-to-one delivery, which can create an unsustainable workload.\n- A fully hands-off video library, which may not provide the personal guidance expected from a premium offer.\nThe proposed middle is “done with you”:\n- Templates and mini-courses provide the structure.\n- Live group calls provide guidance.\n- Direct access allows questions.\n- A tailored plan adapts the system to the customer's situation.\nWhy it may work: the customer gets both a proven framework and help applying it to their own circumstances.",
