        "Record what customers praise, complain about, misunderstand, or still do manually.",
        "Competition is not automatically a reason to abandon an idea. It can indicate demand. Your task is to find a meaningful difference.\n11.3 Create a minimum credible offer\nBuild a one-page description that includes:\n- The target buyer.\n- The problem.\n- The proposed outcome.\n- What the product contains.\n- How it works.\n- Price or expected price range.\n- Delivery status and timeline.\n- Refund or cancellation terms.\n- A waitlist or purchase-intent action.\nDo not imply that a product is complete if it is only a concept.\n11.4 Test with a relevant audience\nShow the offer to people who actually fit the buyer profile. The source suggests niche Facebook groups as one possible place for dog walkers.",
