        "A click is a signal, not proof of a sustainable business. A purchase is stronger evidence, but still does not guarantee retention, low refunds, or profitable delivery.\n11.6 Pre-sell responsibly\nIf you collect payment before the product is complete:\n- State that it is a preorder or early-access offer.\n- Describe exactly what exists now.\n- Give a realistic delivery date.\n- Explain what the buyer will receive.\n- State refund conditions clearly.\n- Keep the money and obligations manageable.\n- Communicate delays promptly.\n- Do not use fake scarcity or invented customer numbers.\nThe source's reported $20,000 presale is an example of validation through paid demand, not a result beginners should expect."
