        "Do not spend weeks polishing a complex website before confirming that the offer matters to buyers.\n15.1 Make delivery reliable\nFor a downloadable product:\n- Test the file.\n- Check mobile readability.\n- Ensure the download link works.\n- Provide a clear start-here guide.\n- Include a version date where relevant.\nFor software:\n- Test the main workflow.\n- Protect user data.\n- Explain supported browsers and integrations.\n- Provide error handling.\n- Document limitations.\n- Have a support and maintenance plan.\nFor a membership:\n- Define access rules.\n- Publish community guidelines.\n- Explain moderation and support hours.\n- Make billing and cancellation clear."
